lwIP is vendored from the upstream STABLE-2_2_1_RELEASE tag at commit
77dcd25a72509eb83f72b033d219b1d40cd8eb95.

Upstream: https://git.savannah.nongnu.org/git/lwip.git
License:  BSD-style license in COPYING

Hans vendors only the core IPv4, ICMP, TCP, UDP, pbuf, netif, memory, and timer
sources listed in the top-level Makefile, plus their upstream headers. The
pinned code is retained verbatim except for four calls to the Hans RTO-floor
macro in core/tcp.c and core/tcp_in.c. Hans-specific NO_SYS configuration, the
finer TCP timer, the conservative RTO floor, and compiler adaptation live in
port/.
